WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.367
-There's so much
going on right now.

00:00:02.367 --> 00:00:05.100
I mean, there's --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:07.601
Today, Rudy Giuliani
appeared before a grand jury

00:00:07.601 --> 00:00:10.901
in Georgia to testify about
election interference.

00:00:10.901 --> 00:00:13.167
HBO is about to debut
its "Game of Thrones"

00:00:13.167 --> 00:00:15.334
prequel series,
"House of the Dragon."

00:00:15.334 --> 00:00:17.300
[ Cheers ]

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:19.934
-Doctors are telling people
to stop doing a TikTok challenge

00:00:19.934 --> 00:00:22.434
where you tape your mouth shut
while you sleep.

00:00:22.434 --> 00:00:23.701
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.701 --> 00:00:26.267
And Capri Sun recalled
thousands of drinks

00:00:26.267 --> 00:00:28.534
because they might contain
cleaning solution.

00:00:28.534 --> 00:00:30.033
-Yeah, there's a lot to go over.

00:00:30.033 --> 00:00:31.634
Let's just jump in
and cover it all at once.

00:00:31.634 --> 00:00:33.267
It's time for a "News Smash."

00:00:33.267 --> 00:00:35.100
♪♪

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:38.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:38.067 --> 00:00:40.367
First up,
Rudy Giuliani is in trouble.

00:00:40.367 --> 00:00:42.601
He's the target
of a Georgia investigation

00:00:42.601 --> 00:00:45.334
into election interference.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.334 --> 00:00:47.267
When he found out,
Rudy shouted a bunch of words

00:00:47.267 --> 00:00:48.701
that you can only say on...

00:00:48.701 --> 00:00:51.467
-HBO.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.467 --> 00:00:54.334
They're about to debut a huge
new "Game of Thrones" prequel

00:00:54.334 --> 00:00:56.367
called "House of the Dragon."

00:00:56.367 --> 00:00:58.434
It takes place 200 years
before the original,

00:00:58.434 --> 00:01:00.801
and it's a great idea, unlike...

00:01:00.801 --> 00:01:02.434
-Taping your mouth shut
before you go to sleep.

00:01:02.434 --> 00:01:03.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.467 --> 00:01:04.901
People are doing it on TikTok,

00:01:04.901 --> 00:01:06.868
but doctors say
it's bad for your health.

00:01:06.868 --> 00:01:08.167
Kind of like...

00:01:08.167 --> 00:01:11.267
-Drinking Capri Sun
spiked with cleaning solution.

00:01:11.267 --> 00:01:12.934
They've recalled
thousands of drinks,

00:01:12.934 --> 00:01:15.767
not to mention those pouches,
which can often...

00:01:15.767 --> 00:01:17.067
-Leak. Rudy...

00:01:17.067 --> 00:01:20.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.033 --> 00:01:21.501
...does it all the time.

00:01:21.501 --> 00:01:24.501
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:24.501 --> 00:01:26.100
Now he's under investigation

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:28.267
by the state of Georgia
and the feds.

00:01:28.267 --> 00:01:30.334
I mean, there's no way that guy
is getting much...

00:01:30.334 --> 00:01:32.167
-Sleep.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.167 --> 00:01:35.367
Come on, TikTok.
Mouth tape, tortilla slapping,

00:01:35.367 --> 00:01:36.968
the face-wax challenge.

00:01:36.968 --> 00:01:39.534
Seems like the only thing
y'all don't allow is...

00:01:39.534 --> 00:01:43.100
-Nudity. "House of the Dragon"
will have lots of it.

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:45.901
So fingers crossed
none of the actors look like...

00:01:45.901 --> 00:01:47.000
-Rudy Giuliani.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:55.467
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:01:55.467 --> 00:01:57.400
I mean, just look at that face.

00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:59.467
That guy
could definitely use some...

00:01:59.467 --> 00:02:01.467
-Cleaning solution.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.467 --> 00:02:03.467
Drinking that would be gross.

00:02:03.467 --> 00:02:04.968
Almost as gross as...

00:02:04.968 --> 00:02:07.901
-Hooking up with your sibling.
[ Laughter and groans ]

00:02:07.901 --> 00:02:09.267
It happened
on "Game of Thrones,"

00:02:09.267 --> 00:02:10.801
and it could happen again.

00:02:10.801 --> 00:02:13.400
But I'm excited for the dragons.
They breathe fire.

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:15.067
And so will you
if you swallow...

00:02:15.067 --> 00:02:16.501
-Pine-Sol Capri Sun.

00:02:16.501 --> 00:02:18.601
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.601 --> 00:02:20.434
So, in conclusion...

00:02:20.434 --> 00:02:21.567
-Ice and fire.

00:02:21.567 --> 00:02:22.934
-Total liar.

00:02:22.934 --> 00:02:24.367
-Nighttime ouch.

00:02:24.367 --> 00:02:26.534
-Clorox pouch.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:26.534 --> 00:02:29.434
This has been a "News Smash."

00:02:29.434 --> 00:02:31.434
♪♪

00:02:31.434 --> 00:02:33.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

